            36225/2/2021-1-RD-EUFRAT-GELINA (CHARPU), as well as
            from I+D+i grants PGC2018-096717-B-C21,
            PID2021-123100NB-I00, PID2022-142589OB-I00, and
            PDC2021-120828-I00 funded by
            MCIN/AEI/10.13039/501100011033. Furthermore, this
            research received partial funding from the National
            Science Centre in Poland (Grant No.
            UMO-2021/41/B/ST2/00326).
