EN-NRM-MIN EN-NRM-MAX MONIT      MONIT-ERR
EV         EV         B*EV       B*EV
 9.0        20.0       1059.      6.
ENDCOMMON            3
ENDSUBENT          120
SUBENT        23677002   20251222   20260826   20260826       2323
BIB                  3         10
REACTION   (94-PU-239(N,F),,SIG)
ANALYSIS   Yield divided by the areal density (6.851E-06 at/b).
           * Adrian Sanchez-Caballero (2025-12-27):
           Multiple scattering and self shielding are negligible.
            (Their impact on the cross section is maximum (1%) at
            the largest resonance and well below in the rest
            region.)
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-S) uncertainty due to counting statistics
           (ERR-1) uncertainty due to neutron fluence shape
            determination
ENDBIB              10
